#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "84_Rumor-loving High School Girl"
msgid "You know this place called Sky Finance?"
msgstr "¿Sabía que este lugar se llama Sky Finance?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "96_Chatty High School Girl"
msgid "Yeah. What about it?"
msgstr "Sí, ¿qué tiene?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "108_Rumor Loving High School Girl"
msgid "Well, it's a place that lends you money. But I\\r\n"
"heard the owner's a hardcore criminal!"
msgstr "Bueno, acá te pueden dar un préstamo.\nPero escuché que el dueño es un gran mafioso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "120_Chatty High School Girl"
msgid "Seriously? What'd he do?"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¿Qué hizo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "132_Rumor-loving High School Girl"
msgid "They say he's a badass yakuza who, like, goes\\r\n"
"around beating people up at random."
msgstr "Dicen que es un yakuza que va por ahí golpeando gente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "144_Chatty High School Girl"
msgid "No way! Really!? Sounds like a scary guy!"
msgstr "¡No me digas! ¡¿En serio?! ¡Debe dar bastante miedo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "156_Rumor-loving High School Girl"
msgid "Not only that, he's killed at least 10 or 20 people!\\r\n"
"And I heard he's been arrested tons of times, too!"
msgstr "Y no solo eso, ¡dicen que ha matado unas 10 o 20 personas! Y también he escuchado que lo han arrestado muchas veces."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "168_Chatty High School Girl"
msgid "No way! How come he's not, like, in prison!?"
msgstr "¡No puede ser! ¡¿Cómo es que no está en prisión?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "180_Rumor-loving High School Girl"
msgid "Duh! 'Cause he's a moneylender! Every time he\\r\n"
"gets arrested, he just gives the cops a boatload\\r\n"
"of money and they let him go."
msgstr "¡Pues obvio, si es un prestamista! Cada que lo arrestan solo tiene que sobornar a los polis para que lo dejen ir."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "192_Chatty High School Girl"
msgid "That's totally messed up!"
msgstr "¡Qué desastre!"
